    { math: '2 · The eruption spectrum', note: 'Hawaiian fountains and rivers (Kīlauea) → Strombolian fireworks → Vulcanian blasts → Plinian columns tens of km high (Vesuvius 79 CE — Pliny\'s account founded volcanology) → the rare caldera-forming supervolcanoes.' },
